本音まで知りたいんでしょ？
You want to know my true feelings, right?

170
00:16:22,231 --> 00:16:25,731
ねえ 目と目反らせないんでしょ？
Hey, you can't look away from my eyes, right?

171
00:16:25,731 --> 00:16:29,031
私しかいないんでしょ？
There's no one else for you but me, right?

172
