Up next...

196
00:18:28,131 --> 00:18:39,031
常闇トワちゃん 新3D...あ、違う！3D新衣装の発表！
Tokoyami Towa's new 3D... Ah, wait! The reveal of my new 3D outfit!

197
00:18:39,031 --> 00:18:43,831
